00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:29.970
at the end of this
second speaker.

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:33.630
Our next speaker,
Arif Harmanci, will

00:20:33.630 --> 00:20:36.420
be discussing the quantification
of private information leakage

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:38.280
from genomic data sets.

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:40.650
Dr. Harmanci received his
PhD from the University

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:43.440
of Rochester in 2011.

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:46.080
He joined the
Gerstein Lab at Yale

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:50.470
as a postdoctoral
researcher in 2011, as well,

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:52.560
and since then has been
working on the development

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:56.640
of analytical tools for
bioinformatics research.

00:20:56.640 --> 00:20:59.310
His primary focus is on
functional genomics data

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:00.310
analysis.

